            <ArticleTitle>Short report: Asthma admissions and weather conditions in Costa Rica.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>514-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In Costa Rica there is little information about asthma admissions. In this report the monthly asthma admissions and weather data for a seven year period were reviewed. The hospital asthma admissions showed notable seasonal variation associated with variations in the rainfall and the relative humidity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
